{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 三期生 山口県出身🐡 20歳の\n谷口愛季(たにぐちあいり)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー 卒業セレモニー ーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、\n先輩の井上梨名さんの卒業セレモニーが行われました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobRceYGi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobMX90E1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobWR8dIC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この笑顔が大好きです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobHKyDYB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobUoKi8g.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業されることを聞いた時から、\nいのりさんのこと、たっくさん笑顔にするぞー！\nと密かに決めていたのですが、\n気付けば逆に、たっっくさん笑顔にさせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入した時からそこさくなどで\n「滑舌同盟」としてお話しさせていただくことが多かったのですが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツに加入させて頂いてからは\nさらに話す機会が増えて、\n「やったー！もっと一緒に過ごす時間が増えるなー！」ってわくわくしてたのに、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう卒業だなんて寂しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "セレモニーの時にゆづが言っていた通り、\nいのりさんは、この人と一緒にお仕事したいって思わせる天才なんだと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し不安な収録もいのりさんがいれば大丈夫って思うことがいくつもあって、、\nたくさん頼りにさせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな時もひたむきにまっすぐ進み続けるいのりさんが大好きです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobAKhvFh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツ井上梨名卒業SP"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1時間の特番となっています！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://tver.jp/episodes/epedr3xxcx"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツメンバー全員で初旅行しましたー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobQgi8Lh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobvrwvub.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobuNLz74.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobzmTUFY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TVerでぜひ 追いミーツ してください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TELASAは番外編も公開されているので、そちらもぜひ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "コソコソミーツもバスの中でやったゲームも\n名探偵ゴロリもとーっても楽しかったです☺️☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮った写真を見返しては、にやにやしてます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ホテルで、明日もあるから早く寝るぞー！って\nわちゃわちゃしてる時間がとーっても楽しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobdiNCTy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りの写真"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねん👋🏻👋🏻"}], "source": "official"}